WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.250
But and so are tiny hinges.

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.920
But says, here comes a surprise:

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:09.710
Caspian’s heart was sinking, but he tried to take it all in.

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:13.420
So says, here’s what happened because of it.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:18.020
Put a comma before each when it joins two whole sentences.
